  "description": "Have you ever gotten that eerie feeling that someone's watching you? That when you turn off the lights, you're not alone? Read these terrifying ghost stories and try not to scream. \n\nA collection of stories by Korea's master of horror, Horang: \n\n1. *The Ghost in the School Stairwell (학교계단 귀신)*\n2-3. *The Ghost in the Fridge (냉장고 귀신)*\n4. *The Street View Ghost (거리뷰 귀신)*\n5-6. *The Ghost in the Elevator (엘레베이터 귀신)*\n7. *The Ghost of Turtle Playground (거북이놀이터 귀신)*\n8. *The Ghost on the Highway (동서로주유소 귀신)*\n9. *The Ghost of Oksu Station -Remastered- (옥수역 귀신 - Remastered -)*\n10. *The Ghost of Bongcheon-dong -Remastered- (봉천동 귀신 - Remastered -)* \n\n(Source: WEBTOONS)",
